3e\udd8d Welcome to Steal a Monke! \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou like to steal. You really, **REALLY** like to steal. Collect wild monkes, grow your fortune, and swipe the best ones from other players! Rebirth to unlock crazy rewards and troll your friends.\n\n**Weekly updates!**\n\n# How to Play\n\n1. Buy your first monke \ud83d\udc12\n2. Sneak into other bases and steal their monkes \ud83c\udfc3\n3. Earn money while you idle \ud83d\udcb0\n4. Rebirth for multipliers and rewards \ud83d\udd04\n5. Buy slaps and items to troll other players \ud83d\udc4b\n\n# Features\n\n- Tons of unique monkes to collect \ud83d\udc35\n- Slaps and troll items \ud83e\uddf0\n- Rebirth rewards and multipliers \ud83d\udd04\n- Play with friends in multiplayer \ud83c\udf10\n\n**Watch your back, other players are coming for your monkes too!** \ud83e\udd4a", "short_description": "# \ud83e\udd8d Welcome to Steal a Monke! \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou like to steal. You really, **REALLY** like to steal. Collect wild monkes, grow your fortune, and swipe the best ones from other players! Rebirth to unlock crazy rewards and troll your friends.\n\n**Weekly updates!**\n\n# How to Play\n\n1. Buy your first monke \ud83d\udc12\n2. Sneak into other bases and steal their monkes \ud83c\udfc3\n3. Earn money while you idle \ud83d\udcb0\n4. Rebirth for multipliers and rewards \ud83d\udd04\n5. Buy slaps and items to troll other players \ud83d\udc4b\n\n# Features\n\n- Tons of unique"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stealamonke.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LarpLogan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://stealamonke.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet